OL,3,GNEWSANHS trust told to improve mental
OL,4,Ahealth service
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt follows an inspection in March, when
OL,7,Fthe CQC found there were not always
OL,8,Fenough qualified or experienced staff
OL,9,Fand the service did not always make
OL,10,Fsure that medicines and treatments were
OL,11,Fsafe and met people's needs.
OL,13,FThe trust said it welcomed the report
OL,14,Fand was working to address many of the
OL,15,Fissues raised.
